OL,3,GNEWSAI swapped gymnastics for diving `
OL,4,Athen competed at the Commonwealth Games
OL,5,
OL,6,FClara Kerr made the switch from
OL,7,Fgymnastics to diving at the age of 11
OL,8,Fand has never looked back.
OL,10,FShe was spotted by a diving coach while
OL,11,Fshe was doing flips at a new pool which
OL,12,Fhad opened in Aberdeen.
OL,14,FSix years later she was representing
OL,15,FScotland at the 2022 Commonwealth Games
OL,16,Fin Birmingham.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
