OL,3,GNEWSAI swapped gymnastics for diving `
OL,4,Athen competed at the Commonwealth Games
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow Kerr is urging other young gymnasts
OL,7,Fto consider the switch as Scottish
OL,8,FSwimming and Aquatics GB launch a
OL,9,Ftalent transfer programme aimed at
OL,10,Fencouraging young athletes from other
OL,11,Fsports to try diving.
